on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 5 .............................. <5>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <5>
  [  5] extcall 24 .............................. <sprite(5)>
  [  7] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 10] setobjprop 39 ........................... sprite(5).visible = 1
  [ 13] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 16] pusharglist 1 ........................... <6>
  [ 18] extcall 24 .............................. <sprite(6)>
  [ 20] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 23] setobjprop 39 ........................... sprite(6).visible = 1
  [ 26] ret
end
